{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented + pushed as **Gerrit 2418** (stacked on 2416/0aee → 2415/fbc0 → 2413/f75f).\n\nOption B (operator-approved) — split the overloaded `coverage.llm_unavailable`:\n- New helper `failure.degrade_cause_flags(error)` → mutually-exclusive `{llm_unavailable, input_rejected}`; `LLMInputRejectedError`→`input_rejected`; else (incl. string tail)→`llm_unavailable`.\n- Both degrade builders route through it (`_degraded_code_review_verdict`, `_degraded_plan_review_verdict`).\n- 3 readers honour it, degrading exactly as for an outage (never hollow PASS): `finalize_verdict`→INDETERMINATE; `drift_floor._recompute_verdict_after_drop` BLOCK→INDETERMINATE; `review_bot/adapter` distinct `input-rejected` gap reason kept OUT of `RETRYABLE_GAP_REASONS` (honest fail-closed, not deferred retry). No broad `degraded` category.\n\nHeld-out TDD: happy-path oracle (helper + code-review builder) shown to implementer; edge/E2E/reader oracle (string default, plan-review E2E, all 3 readers) held out. RED-first 7 failed for right reason → implementer (happy-path only, 1 attempt) → restored full oracle 7 passed. sandbox-exec mutation-teeth: 4 perturbations each killed a held-out test, restored GREEN. lint+typecheck clean; C901 finalize_verdict=11 / _recompute=5. Targeted regression 153 passed. Close pending Verified+1 + LLM-Review+1 on 2418."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788071281622233672,"uuid":"948d25c3-a072-4118-ad3a-af5cd530ff90"}